cse-department-backups/

# Lockfiles are intentionally COMMITTED.
#
# They were previously ignored. That makes installs non-reproducible — a fresh
# clone resolves whatever happens to be latest — and it breaks `npm ci`, which
# requires a lockfile and is what CI and most deploy pipelines run.
#
# This project also needs a pinned resolution: react-helmet-async@2.0.5 does
# not list React 19 as a supported peer, so installs need --legacy-peer-deps
# and the exact resolved tree matters.

# Windows/Cygwin crash dumps — one of these was committed previously.
*.stackdump
